<title>PAKISTAN: SQUASH-MEN'S WORLD OPEN QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SQUASH-MEN'S WORLD OPEN QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter-final results in the</p>
<p>men's World Open squash championship on Wednesday (prefix number</p>
<p>denotes seeding): 5-Chris Walker (England) beat 3-Brett Martin</p>
<p>(Australia) 15-10 12-15 15-9 15-13</p>
<p>4-Peter Nicol (Scotland) beat 9-Craig Rowland (Australia) 15-13</p>
<p>15-6 15-9</p>
<p>1-Jansher Khan (Pakistan) beat 7-Simon Parke (England)  15-3</p>
<p>15-4 15-8</p>
<p> Rodney Eyles (Australia) beat Zubair Jahan (Pakistan)    15-17</p>
<p>13-15 17-15 15-7 15-6.</p>
</text>
